 "lines": [
  "Stop running where defenders can see you.",
  "I broke down Thierry Henry's finishing. Four habits to copy.",
  "His goals look simple. That's the point.",
  "One. He runs between the full-back and the centre-back.",
  "The full-back is blocked by his body. The centre-back can't see him.",
  "Two. With time, he opens his body.",
  "And curls it low into the far corner. Accuracy, not power.",
  "Three. When the keeper rushes out, he stays calm.",
  "In the box, you have more time than you think.",
  "Four. He doesn't dribble past everyone.",
  "One-two, or a run in behind, then finish. Simple goals.",
  "So next game, start your run from their blind side.",
  "Follow for the next one. The free analysis test is in my bio."
 ],
